      stubs used by Server.StartJobs). Bump grpc to v1.83.1 and regenerate the
      checked-in dependency attribution, whose manifest hashes go.mod/go.sum.

    - Build service image: the Alpine 3.24 repository replaced
      ca-certificates 20260611-r0 with 20260909-r0 and tzdata 2026c-r0 with
      2026d-r0, so the exact-version runtime-apk.lock no longer resolves
      ("unable to select packages"). Move the three drifted pins (including
      ca-certificates-bundle, which shares the ca-certificates recipe) so the
      installed set still matches the lock exactly and the corresponding-source
      inventory stays at 69 packages / 52 origins as tests/image-smoke expects.

